# 21. My mental model

When I see:

```java
Student s = new Student();
```

I don't just read it as one line.

I think:

```text
Student object
      ↓
created in Heap

s
↓
reference to that object
```

When I see:

```java
someMethod();
```

I think:

```text
new stack frame
      ↓
method executes
      ↓
frame removed when method returns
```

When I see:

```java
s = null;
```

I think:

```text
reference removed
      ↓
check whether object is still reachable
      ↓
if unreachable → eligible for GC
```

